window.bookSummaryJSON = "<i>She has nothing to live for in the present, but finds there’s something worth dying for in the past…</i><br><br>From Tiffany Reisz, the international bestselling storyteller behind <i>The Bourbon Thief</i> and The Original Sinners series, comes an enthralling new novel about a woman swept away by the tides who awakens to find herself in 1921, reunited with the husband she’s been mourning for four years. Fans of Kate Morton and Diana Gabaldon will fall in love with the mystery, romance and beauty of an isolated South Carolina lighthouse, where a power greater than love works its magic.<br><br>"; 
